    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the fluid looks okay though, no major metal chunks or anything. i checked the solenoids and the wiring seems solid. any other ideas? it just feels like something is sporadically messing with the pressure even when everything looks mechanically fine on the surface.",
